        "data": {
          "title": "Weatherbeater Renovation",
          "summary": "The Weatherbeater fairgrounds are being upgraded into a year-round event destination, hosting livestock and equitation events, 4-H programs, winter concerts, holiday and seasonal programs, vendor fairs, and community gatherings that benefit residents and overnight visitors alike.",
          "intro": "The Weatherbeater fairgrounds are being upgraded to serve as a year-round event destination. Improvements allow the facility to host events in all seasons: from livestock and equitation events and 4-H educational programs in summer, to a winter concert series, holiday and seasonal programs, vendor fairs, and bingo nights. These renovations benefit both local residents and overnight visitors looking for things to do during their travels.",
