          "card_status": "Planning",
          "allocated": 432600,
          "goals": [
            "Transform the Weatherbeater fairgrounds into a year-round event destination capable of hosting events in all seasons",
            "Support livestock and equitation events, 4-H educational programming, winter concerts, holiday and seasonal programs, vendor fairs, and community gatherings",
            "Benefit both local residents and overnight visitors looking for activities during their travels"
